{"from": "claim:lk-21-34-carousing-drunkenness", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-24-43-thief-night-watch", "note": "Luke's snare warning (21:34-35) and Matthew's thief-in-the-night image (24:43) are different pictures of the same sudden coming; Luke alone names carousing, drunkenness and anxieties."}
